From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:44:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 37/39] bitproxy: Mullvad login and share-to-import

Mullvad: log in with the account number, register one WireGuard key as a
device (X25519 key pair made in-app), pick locations and get one server
per city written as a normal .conf. Log out removes the device again.

Share / Open with BitProxy imports WireGuard .conf files or pasted conf
text and applies right away when a BitProxy config exists.
